# User-supplied ROMs and anything derived from them (never commit).
# The *.zip/*.bin/*.nv rules are intentionally global: ROM sets turn up as
# eca.zip, scud.zip, nested zips, extracted .bin regions and NVRAM saves in
# many directories (repo root, run/ROMs/, analysis/, ...), and none of those
# bytes may ever be committed.
roms/*
!roms/README.md
*.zip
*.bin
*.nv
generated/
analysis/
build*/
*.gpr
*.rep/
__pycache__/
